'Captain: changing textures and a hand grab. Firstmate: burned-house ash and small hand. New draft: ridged-star match and contained textures.',
'Tamari performs the touch from a side opening, with a manual sound cue. Captain watches the group. Touch is opt-in; a sound-and-moving-cloth variant preserves the scene. No grip, restraint or moving mechanism near fingers.',
