'Captain: sacrifice to resurrect children and terrible prize. Firstmate: mother with four restored children who are the players. New draft: chest contents, exact reveal line, silhouettes and collective reveal. Literal resurrection versus possession remains a captain choice.',
'Use a clear warm-to-cold lighting change and synchronized voices. Fog is optional atmosphere; the mother is a cutout or actor silhouette, not an assumed projection into free air. No third performer required. Exit and short reset follow.',
